  "solution": {
    "text": "$\\Delta U=q+w$\nFor a adiabatic process, <img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/bitsat/EpoOBhVoZK8PRSTCHkmScAMsbwtBgbBzyA4jM4OmO1w.original.fullsize.png\"/>\n$\\Delta \\mathrm{U}=\\mathrm{w}=-\\mathrm{p}_{\\mathrm{ex}} \\Delta \\mathrm{v}$\nFor free expansion of ideal gas $\\mathrm{p}_0=0$<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/bitsat/jbAX25AGz3stQSHwh9Ex68xoG17N9CzrYfj8hJHrRB0.original.fullsize.png\"/>\nAs $\\Delta \\mathrm{U}=\\mathrm{C} \\Delta \\mathrm{T}=0$<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/bitsat/kUrjF5RhLjsPoYtnP8p6gJmf_-PvCfkswu-pF74hUMo.original.fullsize.png\"/><br/>",
